  "status": "prospective read-only coordinate-metric comparison for independent review",
  "rule": "Only one full gradient and two existing all105-residual JVPs on the valid path at exact retained206. No component objective weighting, BF16 candidate/update, accumulator change, acquisition, full-model file copy or learner control.",
